## ✅ Testing Checklist (Run After Every Change)

### Mandatory Checks:
- [ ] `flutter analyze` shows no errors
- [ ] App runs without crashes
- [ ] Changed feature works correctly

### UI Checks:
- [ ] Light mode displays correctly
- [ ] Dark mode displays correctly
- [ ] Colors adapt to theme

### Layout Checks (if layout changed):
- [ ] RTL layout works correctly
- [ ] No overflow errors
- [ ] Responsive on different screen sizes

### Performance Checks:
- [ ] No jank or lag
- [ ] Lists scroll smoothly
- [ ] No memory leaks (test with many items)

## 🛑 Common Mistakes to Avoid

1. ❌ Using wrong file path
2. ❌ Hardcoding colors
3. ❌ Missing `context.mounted` check
4. ❌ Missing loading/error/empty states
5. ❌ Not testing dark mode
6. ❌ Not testing RTL
7. ❌ Deleting files without checking imports
8. ❌ Skipping `flutter analyze`
